## Escalation trigger (R-9)
If a re-check finds no k, Ls, Lf (or per-model table) that meets all three constraints on the default model, the implementer stops and returns a Design Impact to the Solution Designer; no constraint is relaxed.

## Risk
The Lf margins are thin (+0.0057 / +0.0058 in cosine lift), each set by one question (N04, Q08); the evaluation re-check guards them. While cards are still being embedded, a single off-topic cue can rate Fair by meaning (simulated: N04 at 25%, OT-C4 at 10%); R-10 then shows the coverage note instead of the only-weak note.
